	"Description": "Added marriage possibility, festival participation, spouse room, movie theater, etc.\n<br />\u00A0The original creator is IUMVXR, and the original custom NPC is posted on the IUMVXR Naver blog.\n<br />On the IUVXR Naver Cafe, he can't get married.\n<br />So I added the marriage function.\n<br />The address of the IUMVXR Naver Cafe is https://cafe.naver.com/starvall/190525\n<br />All Naver mods require login.\n<br />I do not speak English as a native language, so I wrote using Korean.\n<br />Please post if you can submit a better translation.\n<br />install\n<br />Install the latest version SMAPI, Content Patcher Mod, TMXL Map Tookit Mod, PyTK (Platonymous Toolikit) Mod.\n<br />[CP] Minu, [TMX] Minu Festival, [TMX] Minu Spouses room the folder folder in Stardew Valley / Mods.\n<br />Launch the game using SMAPI.\n<br />compatibility\n<br />-Compatible with Stardew Valley 1.4.5.\n<br />-MissCoriel's unique courtship response is compatible and recommended, but not required!\n<br />-Not tested on other custom NPCs. Let us know if your schedule conflicts with others!\n<br />\n<br />Minu is a butler.\n<br />It appears when the house is extended to the baby room.\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]There are currently no events.\n<br />It will be added in future updates.[/b][/size]",
